  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes the grotto-heaven’s outer landscape when it is first named. At its center, explorers later find a tiny and exquisite qi harvest fruit the size of a gourd, with flowing lights on its surface and rank nine immortal material aura.",
      "chapters": [
        1996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls Demon Immortal Qi Jue as an Olden Antiquity Era rank eight who fought Limitless Demon Venerable three times, and that the grotto-heaven left after his death lasted to the present. In Fang Yuan’s first life, dream realms and vanishing regional walls expose many hidden blessed lands and grotto-heavens, and Demon Immortal Qi Jue’s grotto heaven is revealed then, causing an uproar. Qi Jue’s Five Words Poem was engraved in that grotto heaven, and the place holds the Demon Immortal’s true inheritance at a level Fang Yuan compares above Hei Fan.",
      "chapters": [
        1319
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "evt_era_olden",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "char_hei_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Luo clan’s three Gu Immortals explore Qi Jue grotto heaven deeply and reach its center. Luo Hao Ze urges haste because qi tides are rampaging and the grotto heaven will stay concealed only briefly, so they must find Qi Jue’s true inheritance before others arrive.",
      "chapters": [
        1987
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-tide-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_luo_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Qi Jue grotto-heaven, Luo clan’s three injured Gu Immortals reach the center and see the qi harvest fruit they deduce as the grotto-heaven’s most valuable holding. They are then swept into a battlefield killer move and realize someone else has also found Qi Jue grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "center-ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
